From d56e967f0101e5d4d3c9f07a4cd0fda47d7df7d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:17:52 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs(examples): add the 3D rest machining catalog case

The case 3d/rest roughs a plate with two ribs with a 12 mm 3D Pocket.
A 6 mm 3D Pocket after it cuts only the 8 mm channel between the ribs
and its two mouths, which the 12 mm tool cannot reach. The test
catalog_3d_rest::the_small_tool_cuts_only_the_rest_region pins this on
the committed program.

Fixes #2867

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
